      "id": "j401-intro",
      "type": "MARKDOWN",
      "mode": "jshell",
      "source": "# Java 401 — Pipelines, Modules & MCP\n\nThis notebook covers Arima Notebooks' **advanced orchestration system**:\n\n| Feature | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| **Cell Anchors** | Name cells for reuse: `//@ anchor: name` |\n| **Dependencies** | Declare execution order: `//@ depends: a, b` |\n| **Namespaces** | Package cell code like Java: `//@ namespace: com.barista.utils` |\n| **Cross-notebook** | Import from any notebook: `//@ depends: notebook:java-101/methods` |\n| **Pipelines** | Chain steps into a workflow: `//@ steps: a, b, c` |\n| **MCP Server** | Expose Arima as an AI agent tool via `/api/mcp/sse` |\n\n> **Prerequisites:** Java 202 · **Level:** Advanced · **Time:** ~40 min",
