      "id": "j401-h2-deps",
      "type": "MARKDOWN",
      "mode": "jshell",
      "source": "## 2. Dependency Chains — Declaring Execution Order\n\n`//@ depends: a, b, c` tells Arima to run cells `a`, `b`, and `c` (and **their** dependencies)\n**before** running this cell. Click **▶ With Deps** on the cell below — it will automatically\nrun `imports`, `math-utils`, and `string-utils` first.\n\nArima uses **Kahn's topological sort** to find the right execution order, and detects circular\ndependencies before starting.",
      "output": "",
      "returnValue": null,
      "executed": false,
      "executionCount": null,
      "error": "",
      "anchor": null,
      "dependsOn": [],
      "pipelineSteps": []
